{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《死有對証》劇情緊湊，當中飾演熱血衝動警察「高俊」的馬貫東，與患有強迫症的法醫「芷昕」陳曉華（Hera）這對歡喜冤家，互動爆笑十足，深受網民關注！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"97095217-6538-4277-b658-b389d81b10ab.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026gXtAUlBDZf1789540814.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"97095217-6538-4277-b658-b389d81b10ab.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前播出一集，高俊隨隊追捕惡霸「暴龍」，二人在後巷展開驚險打鬥後，暴龍竟離奇死於後巷，高俊慘被列為嫌疑人兼勒令停職。為了打探案情，高俊特意請負責解剖的芷昕食飯，打算借機套料。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">芷昕更窒爆高俊：「你畀人停咗職，仲當自己係警察呀？」其後高俊提議去後巷重組案情，再遭女方冷笑秒殺，更正氣凜然拒絕對方埋單：「公職人員規定請食飯唔可以超過5百蚊，何況我同你只係啱啱新認識嘅朋友！」令高俊當場口啞啞，場面極度惹笑。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d05f1bb6-f637-4d84-8ff2-02e8564a036d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GdzBk8SUDc1789540813.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d05f1bb6-f637-4d84-8ff2-02e8564a036d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"aa3b5b1a-5564-4dba-a45a-e1852b4e0c6d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wrveg4YJMA1789540813.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"aa3b5b1a-5564-4dba-a45a-e1852b4e0c6d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">對於網民激讚二人甚有火花，馬貫東接受 <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時直言，雖然與 Hera 是首次合作，但極速磨合。他更大讚對方記憶力驚人：「佢個腦真係好似一部電腦，記性好到驚人，反應又快！對住我同家雄呢兩個不按理出牌嘅演員，佢完全接得住，令成個感覺更加真實自然。」阿東更笑指劇中經常被 Hera 激到「好嬲」，因為對方角色刀槍不入，令他經常感到「好忟但又好好笑」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"66461071-20b9-4259-97aa-bfed70e9b514.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266o4F1ZBAOR1789540813.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"66461071-20b9-4259-97aa-bfed70e9b514.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 提到劇中大量驚險追逐戲，阿東直認全部都是親身上陣真跑：「呢段時間跑過嘅路，仲多過我過去兩年加埋嘅跑步距離，簡直係一次過補返晒所有 Cardio！」雖然跑到身水身汗，但他大讚團隊氣氛極佳，全靠「氣氛擔當」韋家雄狂放笑彈，就算拍到深宵大家都毫無睡意。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T07:39:09.382761+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":581,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}